Restart OHOS native cameras across application visibility changes.

Keep Chromium capture controllers and clients while releasing CameraKit devices
in the background, then recreate them on foreground. Queue late requests until
foreground and cover rapid visibility changes while a launch is being aborted.
The shell uses MediaCaptureDevices::SetApplicationForegroundForOhos on UI; the
existing VideoCaptureManager owns device changes on IO, including utility capture.

Generated against Chromium 154.0.8037.97. Also included in the main adapter patch
for clean builds; this patch upgrades persistent runner trees.

